# DO THIS FIRST {-}

Copy and paste this into your R Console to start positpal, but replace `FILENAME.Rmd` with the name you are going to use for the .R or .Rmd file you are going to upload (rename the template first, e.g. `Group_#_CC4.Rmd`, and use that exact name). **Do not include it as a code chunk.**

```
install.packages("remotes")
